    "starterCode": "def key_rotation(keys: list, n: int) -> list:\n    # TODO: rotate the list right by n positions\n    pass\n",
    "solution": "def key_rotation(keys: list, n: int) -> list:\n    if not keys:\n        return keys\n    n = n % len(keys)\n    return keys[len(keys)-n:] + keys[:len(keys)-n]\n",
